Note that this only take effects on `Component` imported from [`CompatVisitorConfig.oldRuntimePkg`](api:CompatVisitorConfig.oldRuntimePkg).

```js
import { defineConfig } from '@lynx-js/rspeedy'
import { pluginReactLynx } from '@lynx-js/react-rsbuild-plugin'

export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [
    pluginReactLynx({
      compat: {
        addComponentElement: { compilerOnly: true }
      },
    })
  ],
})
```

